<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #edf2ef; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #263331; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dce5df; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; }
    .header { background: #173d3a; border-bottom: 4px solid #d3aa58; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; padding: 36px 24px; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 600; }
    .header .emoji { font-size: 40px; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .month-banner { background: #eaf2ed; color: #17615b; text-align: center; padding: 14px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; border-bottom: 2px solid #cbdcd1; }
    .body { padding: 32px 28px; color: #34413d; line-height: 1.7; }
    .body h2 { color: #17615b; margin-top: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; }
    .verse-card { background: #f5f7f3; border: 1px solid #dce5df; border-left: 4px solid #d3aa58; border-radius: 6px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0; text-align: center; }
    .verse-text { font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; color: #34413d; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 8px 0; }
    .verse-ref { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #17615b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .message-box { background: #eaf2ed; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #34413d; }
    .footer { text-align: center; padding: 24px; font-size: 12px; color: #74827b; border-top: 1px solid #dce5df; background: #f7f9f6; }
    @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) { .container { margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 0; } .body { padding: 26px 20px; } .verse-card { padding: 20px 16px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <span class="emoji">🎉</span>
      <h1>Happy New Month!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="month-banner">
      ✨ Welcome to {{monthName}}!
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Hello {{recipientName}},</h2>
      <p>A new month has dawned, and with it comes a fresh chapter filled with God's promises, purpose, and divine appointments.</p>

      {{#if monthMessage}}
      <div class="message-box">
        {{monthMessage}}
      </div>
      {{/if}}

      {{#if bibleVerse}}
      <div class="verse-card">
        <p class="verse-text">"{{bibleVerse}}"</p>
        {{#if bibleReference}}
        <span class="verse-ref">— {{bibleReference}}</span>
        {{/if}}
      </div>
      {{/if}}

      <p>As you step into this new month, may every plan you set your hands to prosper, and may the light of God's countenance shine upon you and your household.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 24px; font-weight: 600; color: #17615b;">Blessed New Month from all of us at Watergate Church! 🙏✨</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} Watergate Church Global. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
